---
// 频道×标签组合着陆页（≥3 条才生成，票 08 门槛）：静态网格，零 JS
import Base from "../../../../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Sidebar from "../../../../../components/Sidebar.astro";
import Payload from "../../../../../components/Payload.astro";
import CardV2 from "../../../../../components/CardV2.astro";
import { ui, LOCALES } from "../../../../../i18n";
import { items, itemsWithTag, categories, tagById, COMBO_MIN } from "../../../../../lib/data";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return LOCALES.flatMap((locale) =>
    categories.flatMap((c: any) => {
      const catTagIds = [...new Set(items.filter((i: any) => i.category === c.slug).flatMap((i: any) => i.tags))];
      return catTagIds
        .filter((id) => itemsWithTag(id).length >= COMBO_MIN)
        .map((id) => ({ params: { locale, cat: c.slug, tag: id.split(":")[1] }, props: { cat: c, tagId: id } }));
    })
  );
}
const { locale } = Astro.params;
const cat = Astro.props.cat as any;
const tagId = Astro.props.tagId as string;
const tag = tagById.get(tagId);
const t = ui[locale as keyof typeof ui];
const list = itemsWithTag(tagId).filter((i: any) => i.category === cat.slug);
const title = locale === "zh"
  ? `${tag.name.zh} × ${cat.name.zh} 开源 UI 库（${list.length} 个） — Uicurio`
  : `${tag.name.en} ${cat.name.en} — ${list.length} Curated UI Libraries · Uicurio`;
const description = locale === "zh"
  ? `在「${cat.name.zh}」频道中精选的 ${list.length} 个 ${tag.name.zh} 标签开源 UI 库与交互设计工程藏品，支持组件列表检索与在线预览。`
  : `Curated collection of ${list.length} ${tag.name.en} libraries in ${cat.name.en}. Explore component breakdowns, GitHub sources and live interactive demos.`;

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Uicurio",
      "item": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/${locale}/`
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": cat.name[locale] ?? cat.name.en,
      "item": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/${locale}/collections/${cat.slug}/`
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 3,
      "name": tag.name[locale] ?? tag.name.en,
      "item": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/${locale}/collections/${cat.slug}/tag/${tag.slug}/`
    }
  ]
};

const collectionSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": title,
  "description": description,
  "url": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/${locale}/collections/${cat.slug}/tag/${tag.slug}/`,
  "inLanguage": locale === "zh" ? "zh-CN" : "en-US",
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "numberOfItems": list.length,
    "itemListElement": list.map((item: any, idx: number) => ({
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": idx + 1,
      "name": item.name[locale] ?? item.name.en,
      "url": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/${locale}/item/${item.slug}/`,
      "image": `https://uicurio.shinji.me/assets/shots/${item.screenshot}`
    }))
  }
};
---
<Base locale={locale as any} title={title} description={description} ogImage={`/assets/shots/${list[0]?.screenshot}`}>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(collectionSchema)} />
  <div class="shell">
    <Sidebar locale={locale} currentCat={cat.slug} showFacets={false} total={items.length} categories={categories.map((c: any) => ({ ...c, count: items.filter((i: any) => i.category === c.slug).length }))} />
    <main class="main">
      <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={`/${locale}/`}>Uicurio</a>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href={`/${locale}/collections/${cat.slug}/`}>{cat.name[locale]}</a>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a href={`/${locale}/tags/${tag.slug}/`}>{tag.name[locale]}</a>
        <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">{cat.name[locale]}</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:18px 0 4px">{tag.name[locale]} × {cat.name[locale]}</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-2)">{description}</p>
      <div class="grid">{list.map((i: any, idx: number) => <CardV2 item={i} locale={locale} index={idx} />)}</div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <Payload locale={locale} page="info" />
</Base>
